      "name": null,
      "problem": "Factor the expression $16{a}^{2}-81.$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we write the expression as a difference of squares:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}16{a}^{2}-81 & =(4a)^{2}-{9}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we factor the expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(4a)^{2}-{9}^{2} & =(4a+9)(4a-9)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
